0:{"buildId":"OG8eCAthKGUJyzKMGQdxl","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","$L2",null,{"title":"Server-Authoritative Pricing","description":"How Adkit protects publishers from price manipulation.","content":"## The Problem\n\nClient-side pricing can be manipulated. If prices are set in JavaScript, attackers can modify them before checkout.\n\n## The Solution\n\nAdkit uses server-authoritative pricing. Prices are stored on our servers and validated at checkout. The client never controls the price.\n\n## How It Works\n\n1. Publisher sets price in dashboard (server-side)\n2. SDK fetches price from API for display\n3. At checkout, server validates the price again\n4. Payment is processed at the server-verified price\n\nThis prevents any client-side price manipulation.","slug":"concepts/pricing"}],[["$","script","script-0",{"src":"/_next/static/chunks/10623e2afbf6a84c.js","async":true}]],["$","$L3",null,{"children":["$","$4",null,{"name":"Next.MetadataOutlet","children":"$@5"}]}]]}],"loading":null,"isPartial":false}
